    "Every active worker references exact contract hashes and one command dependency epoch, never floating latest.",
    "Every substrate-dependent worker references a populated-data reality receipt, not schema inference alone.",
    "Every integration tranche references one exact worker head SHA.",
    "Any changed frozen dependency marks the transitive affected-worker set stale until a dependency-refresh receipt is accepted.",
    "No shared semantic resource has more than one active write lease.",
    "No cross-worker interface is implementation-closed without producer, consumer and seam conformance against the same contract hash.",
